SectionRing -- computing the section ring of a Weil Divisor
***********************************************************

Description
===========

This package provides a method for computing the section ring of a Weil
divisor.

Author
======

  * Andrew Bydlon (see http://www.math.utah.edu/~bydlon/ )
    <thelongdivider@gmail.com>

